  <h2>Brownie Batter or Choco Brownie Extreme?</h2>
  <p>Pick Brownie Batter if you like soft, sweet and fudgy. Pick the <a href="/items/choco-brownie-blizzard">Choco Brownie Extreme</a> if you want chewy brownie chunks and a darker chocolate taste. Both cost the same.</p>

  <h2>Other chocolate Blizzards to try</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="/items/oreo-blizzard">Oreo</a>: chocolate cookie crunch, lighter at 420 calories for a Small.</li>
    <li><a href="/items/cookie-dough-blizzard">Cookie Dough</a>: chewy dough with fudge.</li>
    <li><a href="/items/royal-oreo-blizzard">Royal Oreo</a>: Oreo with a hot fudge center.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Every flavor and price is on the <a href="/categories/blizzard-treats">Blizzard menu</a>.</p>
